<h1>Hospitality</h1>
<p class="story-lead">Guest requests and the engineering list were kept apart. A room marked ready in one place was still waiting on a repair in the other.</p>
<p>Housekeeping closed a room in a chat, and engineering still had the job open on a sheet. The evening shift found out when the guest arrived.</p>
<p>They tied guest requests, rooms, and engineering work to the property. The evening shift now sees what is still open before the room is offered again.</p>
